OL,3,GNEWSAFrom pit-stops to go-to           
OL,4,Adestinations: The transformation of    
OL,5,Aservice stations                       
OL,7,FService stations have been a fixture on
OL,8,Fthe nation's motorway network for more 
OL,9,Fthan six decades, but while they may   
OL,10,Fonce have been just a place to go when 
OL,11,Fneeding a break on a long drive, could 
OL,12,Fit be that these roadside retreats have
OL,13,Fnow evolved into destinations in their 
OL,14,Fown right?                             
OL,16,FNext to the motorway near Rotherham,   
OL,17,Fwhere traffic seems to be forever      
OL,18,Fthundering by, is a covered square,    
OL,19,Fsurrounded by what at first appears to 
OL,20,Fbe sandy-coloured stone buildings - and
OL,21,Fthere is a general air of calm.        
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
