OL,3,GNEWSAFrom pit-stops to go-to           
OL,4,Adestinations: The transformation of    
OL,5,Aservice stations                       
OL,7,FBut this is not one of many pretty     
OL,8,Frural villages that dot the Yorkshire  
OL,9,Fcountryside - this is actually the     
OL,10,Fservice station which was recently     
OL,11,Fnamed in survey as the UK's favourite. 
OL,13,FWhile it is only mid-morning, the      
OL,14,FWelcome Break site's concourse is      
OL,15,Falready bustling.                      
